            "notes": "Checks how far the system clock is off from the NTP server ntpd synchronizes to, in milliseconds, and how long ago ntpd last synchronized it, for ntp and NTPsec. Alerts when the offset or the time since the last synchronization exceeds the configured thresholds, when the stratum is too high, when too few NTP sources are usable, or when ntpd uses no NTP server, including when it only uses its local clock.",
